 a more efficient solution?</p>
<p>A <strong>two-pointer approach</strong> is worth considering here becaus=
e a sorted array allows us to move the pointers in a logical way. Let's see=
 how this works in the example below:</p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display: flex; justify-content: center=
;"><img alt=3D"Image represents a sample input for a coding problem likely =
